%F A029407 a(n) = floor((n+61)*(n^2-n+433)/28800 - (n mod 2)*(n^2+35*n)/1920 + ((n^2+3*n+2) mod 4)*n/192 + ((2*n^2+3) mod 5)*n/50 - ((4*n^3+n^2+3*n) mod 5)/5 + (2*((n+9) mod 10) - ((n+5) mod 10) + ((n+4) mod 10) - 2*(n mod 10))/50). - _Hoang Xuan Thanh_, Aug 10 2026
